# AIOS Client Environment — Credential Template
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# This file is populated by /onboard after asking the client which tools they use.
# Each variable below corresponds to an integration documented in connections.md.
#
# How it works:
#   1. /onboard fills in the variables this client needs
#   2. /install asks for each value interactively and writes them to .env
#   3. .env stays on this machine only — never committed to GitHub
#
# Naming convention: SERVICE_PURPOSE=value
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

# (Variables will be added here by /onboard based on the client's tool stack.)
